Spanish Wiktionary dictionary package

Source: Kaikki.org Spanish Wiktionary JSONL export
Source data derives from Wiktionary and is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
Kaikki.org project: https://kaikki.org/
Wiktionary: https://www.wiktionary.org/
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The local runtime package is generated by langLSRW tooling from the
owner-provided upstream JSONL file kept outside the deployed web app.

frequency.tsv (Spanish lemma frequency ranks used for the 词库 categories)

Source: doozan/spanish_data frequency.csv (https://github.com/doozan/spanish_data),
built from hermitdave/FrequencyWords (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords)
OpenSubtitles word lists and merged into Wiktionary lemmas.
License: CC BY-SA 3.0 as stated by doozan/spanish_data (FrequencyWords lists: CC BY-SA 4.0).
Attribution: doozan/spanish_data, hermitdave/FrequencyWords, OpenSubtitles.org.
Generated by tools/build-spanish-frequency.py (proper nouns, letters, prefixes, and
unmatched word forms removed; ranks recomputed); shared under CC BY-SA.
